WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.619
Disgaea

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:16.915
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:17.026 --> 00:00:21.986
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.704
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:00:29.805 --> 00:00:34.936
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:00:37.179 --> 00:00:43.482
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:00:43.586 --> 00:00:49.718
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:00:49.825 --> 00:00:55.889
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:01:02.563
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:02.738 --> 00:01:09.109
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:09.211 --> 00:01:12.408
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:12.648 --> 00:01:14.912
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.552
I'll give you my love.

00:01:52.088 --> 00:01:54.215
Welcome to
the saloon!

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.350
My, how rude!

00:01:59.729 --> 00:02:02.798
Table for a party
of three!

00:02:02.798 --> 00:02:08.737
Netherworld Siblings

00:02:09.472 --> 00:02:13.272
It's too early in the morning to have something
that disgusting shoved in my face...

00:02:13.809 --> 00:02:15.071
I think I'm going
to throw up.

00:02:15.378 --> 00:02:18.313
Hi! Boo-Boop-Be-Doo!

00:02:19.115 --> 00:02:21.106
Hello, Mr. Gordon!
Good morning!

00:02:21.584 --> 00:02:23.108
You're working here
this time?

00:02:23.619 --> 00:02:26.019
You still haven't earned enough
to pay your repair bill?

00:02:26.455 --> 00:02:31.415
Oh, don't you worry about us!
We'll have enough any day now!

00:02:32.428 --> 00:02:36.098
By the way, Prince, I had no idea
that you had a little sister.

00:02:36.098 --> 00:02:37.087
What?!

00:02:37.199 --> 00:02:38.996
A little sister?!

00:02:39.101 --> 00:02:41.865
Um... This is the first
that I've heard of this.

00:02:42.004 --> 00:02:45.030
Of course it is!
I don't HAVE a little sister!

00:02:45.574 --> 00:02:48.168
Really? But we met
her yesterday.

00:02:48.544 --> 00:02:52.503
SHE SAVED US WHEN WE WERE ABOUT TO
BE MUGGED BYA GANG OF DELINQUENTS.

00:02:52.815 --> 00:02:54.783
This has to be some
kind of mistake.

00:02:54.884 --> 00:02:56.909
Extra! Extra, dood!

00:02:57.353 --> 00:03:01.847
In a shocking turn of events, Krichevskoy
had another child besides Prince Laharl!

00:03:02.525 --> 00:03:03.958
What did you say?!

00:03:06.962 --> 00:03:09.089
Are you okay, Prinny?

00:03:13.102 --> 00:03:13.966
Wha...?

00:03:14.403 --> 00:03:20.137
I am Maharl, rightful heir to King
Krichevskoy, the previous Overlord.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:24.675
In my father's place, I will restore
order to the Netherworld!

00:03:25.214 --> 00:03:27.341
Yes, that's the girl!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.748
What do you think? Doesn't she
look just like the Prince here?

00:03:30.152 --> 00:03:32.120
This is an such
an obvious trick...

00:03:33.856 --> 00:03:36.120
Doesn't she have a ferocious
look in her eye?

00:03:36.459 --> 00:03:39.394
She looks like she was
born to be Overlord.

00:03:39.695 --> 00:03:41.595
I wonder who's more powerful,
her or Laharl?

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:42.697
10 HL on Laharl!

00:03:42.832 --> 00:03:44.265
20 on the kid sister!

00:03:44.633 --> 00:03:47.693
Gosh, I can't believe that you
have a little sister, Laharl...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.668
I bet you're dying to meet her!
Or even for a glimpse of her!

00:03:51.073 --> 00:03:53.234
Didn't I just tell you that
I don't have a sister?!

00:03:53.676 --> 00:03:55.371
I don't want my vassals
buying into this nonsense, too!

00:03:56.579 --> 00:03:59.878
Hey, junkheap! Get in gear and
go bring me something to eat!

00:04:00.149 --> 00:04:01.616
Y-YES, SIR!

00:04:10.693 --> 00:04:13.560
Speak of the devil!
It's the Prince's sister!

00:04:13.662 --> 00:04:14.560
Maharl?

00:04:14.697 --> 00:04:17.427
Wow, are we in for a tearjerker
first meeting here?!

00:04:17.533 --> 00:04:19.023
This oughta be good!

00:04:21.203 --> 00:04:23.171
Help me, Laharl...

00:04:23.472 --> 00:04:26.839
Please, you have to hide me,
big brother...

00:04:27.443 --> 00:04:29.434
- What?
- Hide her?

00:04:30.179 --> 00:04:31.703
I don't know you.

00:04:36.085 --> 00:04:37.518
Maharl's collapsed!

00:04:38.154 --> 00:04:39.382
Are you all right?

00:04:39.488 --> 00:04:41.888
Ignore her. I don't
want any trouble.

00:04:42.124 --> 00:04:46.493
How can you say such a thing?!
She's your one and only little sister, isn't she?

00:04:52.101 --> 00:04:53.830
That sound! It's the
Netherworld Emperors!

00:04:53.936 --> 00:04:56.268
Oh, my! Are they really
important people?

00:04:56.405 --> 00:04:58.236
They're a backwoods
biker gang.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.706
But he said they
were emperors.

00:05:01.143 --> 00:05:04.271
They were put out of business
during King Krichevskoy's reign,

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.780
but they've been making
a comeback recently.

00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:09.248
The Netherworld Emperors...

00:05:12.154 --> 00:05:14.486
Um, hello?
What's the matter?

00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:27.466
You don't suppose that she's being
chased by these people, do you?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.929
She ran in here, no doubt about it.
Look for her.

00:05:32.341 --> 00:05:36.072
Just a moment! Who gave you permission
to enter this establishment?!

00:05:36.345 --> 00:05:38.472
We reserve the right to refuse
service to bike gangs!

00:05:38.581 --> 00:05:39.912
PLEASE LEAVE.

00:05:40.416 --> 00:05:41.678
Stand aside.

00:05:42.418 --> 00:05:44.511
This is all the screen time
we get?!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.920
We have to catch her while
we have the chance.

00:05:47.256 --> 00:05:50.225
Hey, did a pint-sized kid
come in here?

00:05:50.326 --> 00:05:52.351
We're looking for a little girl
named Maharl.

00:05:52.928 --> 00:05:55.863
The thing is, we're certain that
she ran into this bar...

00:05:56.332 --> 00:05:58.061
Are you SURE you
haven't seen her?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.428
Anyone who hides her will
be shown no mercy!

00:06:02.905 --> 00:06:05.430
We'll talk, we'll talk!
Actually, she's...

00:06:05.774 --> 00:06:10.973
With God as my witness, I swear that
there is no girl under this table!

00:06:12.748 --> 00:06:14.648
Flonne, could you be
any more obvious?

00:06:16.252 --> 00:06:17.344
Stand aside!

00:06:17.453 --> 00:06:20.217
I won't! No one is hiding
underneath this table!

00:06:20.422 --> 00:06:23.323
Oh, give it a rest!
Get out of the way, already!

00:06:23.425 --> 00:06:25.620
No one is under here!

00:06:25.728 --> 00:06:28.128
Stop it, you're kicking up dust!
I'm eating here!

00:06:28.731 --> 00:06:30.631
So, you must
be Laharl.

00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:34.362
You bested us when last we met,
but this time will be different!

00:06:34.637 --> 00:06:35.467
Friends of yours?

00:06:35.571 --> 00:06:36.503
I dunno.

00:06:36.605 --> 00:06:37.537
What?!

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:40.272
The two things that annoy me
more than anything else...

00:06:40.376 --> 00:06:43.402
...is being bothered when I'm sleeping
and when I'm eating!

00:06:45.481 --> 00:06:50.180
It isn't you that we're after.
Please accept our apologies.

00:06:50.586 --> 00:06:53.578
We'll leave for now
out of deference to you.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.422
Let's go.

00:07:08.404 --> 00:07:11.862
Thank you for saving me,
big brother.

00:07:12.474 --> 00:07:16.570
Stop calling me that. And for one thing,
I don't recall "saving" you.

00:07:17.012 --> 00:07:19.276
I chased them off because they were
interrupting my meal, that's all.

00:07:19.448 --> 00:07:23.009
Say what you will, you've sure turned
into a real softie lately.

00:07:23.585 --> 00:07:27.282
Given the circumstances, don't you think we
should take Maharl under our protection?

00:07:30.993 --> 00:07:32.017
Fine, whatever.

00:07:33.195 --> 00:07:35.755
What in the world are
you thinking, Highness?!

00:07:36.098 --> 00:07:38.498
The ability to show kindness
to demons has finally...

00:07:38.634 --> 00:07:40.499
...begun to blossom
in your heart!

00:07:40.869 --> 00:07:44.805
Now that that's settled, let's go.
I can't eat in peace here.

00:07:47.843 --> 00:07:49.868
As if. You ate everything
in sight.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:56.812
Here's another question, then. Where did
King Krichevskoy and your mother meet?

00:07:57.219 --> 00:07:58.413
Where my mommy works!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.418
Where's that?

00:07:59.521 --> 00:08:00.783
The Black Garden!

00:08:00.889 --> 00:08:03.449
My, what a
beautiful name!

00:08:03.592 --> 00:08:04.616
What do they
do there?

00:08:04.827 --> 00:08:08.058
It's a place where you can talk
to girls while you have a drink!

00:08:08.263 --> 00:08:14.862
But it's with a different girl each time,
and the men have to buy the girl's drink.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.494
Sometimes, they buy
them presents, too.

00:08:16.605 --> 00:08:19.039
I get it! I get it,
so please stop!

00:08:19.308 --> 00:08:23.074
What's the matter, Etna?
You should be more patient.

00:08:23.679 --> 00:08:27.809
Um, won't they see us on
a busy street like this?

00:08:27.916 --> 00:08:30.350
But Laharl told us
to sit here.

00:08:30.452 --> 00:08:33.114
It's what they call "hiding
in plain sight," get it?

00:08:33.422 --> 00:08:35.253
We're actually less conspicuous
out here.

00:08:35.524 --> 00:08:38.220
Oh, big brother said
to stay here, did he?

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.294
We can stay out here
in the open, then.

00:08:40.629 --> 00:08:44.588
Uppity little pipsqueak... Highness, why are
you playing along with this little fake?

00:08:48.704 --> 00:08:51.901
I can hear every word
you say about me!

00:08:52.574 --> 00:08:56.203
She's just like the Prince, right down
to his killer hearing...

00:08:56.945 --> 00:08:57.969
What did you say
about me?

00:09:00.249 --> 00:09:02.581
Live it up while
you still can.

00:09:03.051 --> 00:09:06.578
What do you hope to gain by
pretending to be my sister?

00:09:06.989 --> 00:09:08.479
I'm gonna find out what
you're really up to.

00:09:08.824 --> 00:09:10.587
Big brother!

00:09:10.726 --> 00:09:12.956
S-Stop calling me that!

00:09:13.195 --> 00:09:15.095
So anyway,
are you hungry?

00:09:15.197 --> 00:09:17.995
It's my treat, so name anything,
and I'll get it for you.

00:09:20.502 --> 00:09:23.665
Oh, Laharl! I'm so proud
of all this brotherly love!

00:09:23.939 --> 00:09:25.236
He's lulling her into a
false sense of security.

00:09:25.374 --> 00:09:29.174
His plan is to be nice to her
to find out why she came to him.

00:09:29.578 --> 00:09:33.014
I wanna eat pickled
dragon skin!

00:09:33.115 --> 00:09:37.176
Pickled dragon skin?! But that's one of the
three great delicacies of the Netherworld!

00:09:37.486 --> 00:09:39.613
Even I haven't eaten
that before!

00:09:40.055 --> 00:09:42.455
Is it that expensive?

00:09:42.724 --> 00:09:45.955
Sure, it's expensive, all right!
But it's also illegal!

00:09:46.228 --> 00:09:47.525
Pick something else.

00:09:47.729 --> 00:09:50.095
But you said I could have
anything I wanted!

00:09:50.199 --> 00:09:51.928
And pickled dragon skin
is what I want!

00:09:52.034 --> 00:09:55.197
I wanna eat pickled
dragon skin!

00:09:55.404 --> 00:09:57.269
Is that kid serious?

00:09:57.473 --> 00:09:59.668
If she eats pickled
dragon skin, she'll be...

00:10:02.845 --> 00:10:04.278
Move it!
Come on, hurry!

00:10:06.715 --> 00:10:09.912
Hey, cook.
You have any pickled dragon skin?

00:10:10.319 --> 00:10:11.616
Do you have any
pickled dragon skin?

00:10:12.788 --> 00:10:13.550
Do you...

00:10:16.391 --> 00:10:17.551
Youngster.

00:10:18.093 --> 00:10:21.551
If you're looking for pickled dragon skin,
I just happen to have one piece left.

00:10:22.598 --> 00:10:24.896
Excellent! I owe you one,
old man!

00:10:25.901 --> 00:10:26.799
What's wrong?

00:10:26.902 --> 00:10:29.564
Well, the things is...

00:10:30.072 --> 00:10:33.872
I feel like eating something
that's plain and simple now.

00:10:35.444 --> 00:10:37.935
Are you jerking
me around, kid?!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.545
Well, I don't feel like
eating it anymore.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:46.783
Your plan was to butter her up, but she's totally
taking you for a ride, isn't she, Highness?

00:10:46.889 --> 00:10:48.880
Be quiet!
Call in the Prinnies!

00:10:49.658 --> 00:10:51.888
I'm stuffed!

00:10:51.994 --> 00:10:52.619
So busy!

00:10:52.728 --> 00:10:53.558
So busy!

00:10:53.662 --> 00:10:54.959
So busy!

00:10:55.063 --> 00:10:57.623
I expect dessert next,
got it?!

00:10:58.133 --> 00:11:00.601
She's taking you for a ride!
She's taking you for a ride!

00:11:00.702 --> 00:11:01.669
Who asked you?!

00:11:01.803 --> 00:11:04.135
Don't you know how
to do anything?!

00:11:04.273 --> 00:11:07.037
The non-recyclable trash goes over there,
and the recyclable trash goes over there!

00:11:07.142 --> 00:11:08.837
Make sure it's properly sorted
before you throw it out!

00:11:08.944 --> 00:11:10.707
You're making me
very cross!

00:11:12.281 --> 00:11:13.942
Great, we have another nutjob
to deal with, dood...

00:11:14.049 --> 00:11:16.415
Prince Laharl sure has trouble
with girls, dood...

00:11:16.552 --> 00:11:18.952
She's taking you for a ride!
She's taking you for a ride!

00:11:19.054 --> 00:11:20.783
SHUT UP!

00:11:21.723 --> 00:11:25.215
I can't walk any farther!
My feet hurt, big brother!

00:11:25.827 --> 00:11:27.351
Why do I have
to do this?

00:11:28.063 --> 00:11:30.657
She's literally taking you for a ride!
She's literally taking you for a ride!

00:11:31.667 --> 00:11:33.362
I want that!
Get it for me!

00:11:34.036 --> 00:11:35.469
Why should I have
to do that?

00:11:35.637 --> 00:11:38.162
Because you're my vassal,
that's why!

00:11:38.607 --> 00:11:40.734
Um, I'm not your vassal,
Maharl, I'm...

00:11:41.209 --> 00:11:44.144
My big brother's vassals
are by definition my vassals!

00:11:44.346 --> 00:11:47.315
Gosh, she sounds just like
a certain someone I know...

00:11:48.216 --> 00:11:49.740
Buy me things!

00:11:50.118 --> 00:11:51.483
Taiyaki!

00:11:52.054 --> 00:11:56.491
Forcing an angel do my bidding
is oh such fun!

00:11:58.994 --> 00:12:02.225
What's taking you so long, you people?!
Over here! Over here!

00:12:02.331 --> 00:12:04.959
If you don't hurry, I'm gonna get into
the bath first and hog it all to myself!

00:12:05.734 --> 00:12:09.693
Highness, are you gonna keep letting
her jerk you around like this?

00:12:09.938 --> 00:12:11.235
Of course I'm not...

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.103
Time for a change
of plan.

00:12:21.216 --> 00:12:23.184
Disgaea

00:12:24.252 --> 00:12:30.191
Disgaea

00:12:39.101 --> 00:12:41.296
Big brother?
Are you asleep?

00:12:41.403 --> 00:12:42.165
Yes.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:45.671
I had a scary dream...
Can I sleep with you?

00:12:45.907 --> 00:12:50.344
Any demon who's scared of a little nightmare
will never be a good Overlord.

00:12:50.612 --> 00:12:51.579
Yay!

00:12:51.713 --> 00:12:55.479
I'm so happy!
I've been dying to do this.

00:12:55.584 --> 00:12:59.020
I've felt lonely ever since I found out
that I had a big brother.

00:12:59.454 --> 00:13:01.922
Whenever you feel lonely, you'd do well
to remember our old man's words.

00:13:02.891 --> 00:13:04.518
You DO remember,
don't you?

00:13:04.626 --> 00:13:06.594
Of course I do!
"Act like a demon!"

00:13:07.029 --> 00:13:07.620
Right?

00:13:07.763 --> 00:13:09.287
T-That's right.

00:13:09.698 --> 00:13:13.896
How could I forget that?
It's something that our dear old daddy said.

00:13:14.403 --> 00:13:18.840
Big brother, where do you suppose
the "Black Lizard's Tail" is?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.999
You know, the most secret of all the
treasures passed down in the royal...

00:13:21.143 --> 00:13:22.041
How did you...

00:13:22.144 --> 00:13:23.441
You don't know?

00:13:23.545 --> 00:13:27.481
No. My old man was the only one who knew,
but he died before he could tell me.

00:13:27.816 --> 00:13:29.909
So now I'm looking for it
like everyone else.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.285
Wouldn't it be great
if you found it?

00:13:33.622 --> 00:13:35.556
Do you carry that doll
everywhere you go?

00:13:35.657 --> 00:13:38.455
I sure do. After all, it's
a memento from my mommy.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:39.584
My mommy...

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.895
A memento, huh?

00:13:47.703 --> 00:13:49.603
Big brother...

00:13:51.707 --> 00:13:54.403
Well played. You're more formidable
than I thought...

00:14:10.258 --> 00:14:14.820
Oh, for crying out loud! How come those
two are all buddy-buddy all of a sudden?

00:14:17.966 --> 00:14:20.958
I've loved you for as long as
I can remember, big brother!

00:14:23.238 --> 00:14:24.535
Maharl...

00:14:29.745 --> 00:14:31.736
I feel sick! I feel sick!
I feel sick!

00:14:31.847 --> 00:14:34.213
Then maybe you oughta puke and
get it out of your system, dood.

00:14:35.383 --> 00:14:38.079
That's not what
I meant!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.386
What's all the ruckus
in here?

00:14:41.623 --> 00:14:44.091
We were ordered by the great Maharl
to clean the place, that's what!

00:14:44.192 --> 00:14:45.159
By Maharl?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:50.027
C'mon... You don't actually believe that she's
really your sister, do you, Highness?

00:14:50.599 --> 00:14:55.263
She knew my old man's favorite saying, and
she even knew about the Black Lizard's Tail.

00:14:55.537 --> 00:14:57.767
How could she know that? Where did
the get that intel?! Who told her?!

00:14:58.173 --> 00:15:00.937
I wish I knew. She's my enemy,
but she's earned my respect.

00:15:01.042 --> 00:15:02.373
I almost wish she was
my vassal.

00:15:02.778 --> 00:15:06.077
Oh, it'd be silly for you to make
your little sister into a vassal...

00:15:06.314 --> 00:15:08.942
Get it through your thick skull!
She's not his little sister!

00:15:17.392 --> 00:15:19.519
Laharl! She has
a terrible fever!

00:15:19.961 --> 00:15:25.024
I want to have some of daddy's homemade
porridge of the damned...

00:15:25.734 --> 00:15:28.202
You even know
about that?

00:15:31.973 --> 00:15:34.874
This is your father's
special porridge.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.508
Eat this, and you'll
feel better in no time.

00:15:46.454 --> 00:15:48.445
Whoa! Highness,
you can cook?!

00:15:48.557 --> 00:15:52.425
Demons actually EAT this stuff?
The power of love is strong, indeed...

00:15:53.829 --> 00:15:57.390
Porridge...
Yummy...

00:15:57.933 --> 00:15:59.798
I'm glad to hear it.

00:15:59.935 --> 00:16:03.302
This is porridge that your big brother
made from scratch all by himself.

00:16:03.405 --> 00:16:04.429
Have some more.

00:16:04.539 --> 00:16:05.972
What a touching scene!

00:16:06.074 --> 00:16:09.339
Maybe, but I have no idea what
the Prince is thinking...

00:16:10.078 --> 00:16:11.943
How much of this is
part of his plan?!

00:16:16.051 --> 00:16:17.279
Big brother...

00:16:17.385 --> 00:16:18.716
Big brother...

00:16:21.056 --> 00:16:22.216
Come with me!
Come with me!

00:16:22.324 --> 00:16:24.758
Hey, just because you're feeling
better doesn't mean that...

00:16:24.893 --> 00:16:27.054
I want you to see something,
that's all!

00:16:27.195 --> 00:16:29.561
Look at that!
See?

00:16:30.565 --> 00:16:32.032
Well, well, if it isn't
the Mid-Boss.

00:16:32.133 --> 00:16:35.432
My goodness, what an enchanting
mademoiselle you have on your arm.

00:16:36.137 --> 00:16:37.695
I'm Maharl, his sister.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.970
HIS SISTER?!

00:16:41.543 --> 00:16:46.480
Pardon me if this seems out of turn,
but what might your mother's name be?

00:16:46.815 --> 00:16:48.316
No, forget I asked!
Don't tell me!

00:16:48.316 --> 00:16:50.375
I don't want to know!
I don't want to know!

00:16:50.719 --> 00:16:52.983
What are you getting
so agitated about?

00:16:53.321 --> 00:16:55.312
Is this man
always like this?

00:16:55.423 --> 00:16:58.358
Yeah. Don't talk to him,
his stupidity is contagious.

00:16:58.727 --> 00:16:59.751
Come on, let's go.

00:17:01.897 --> 00:17:02.921
Wait!

00:17:10.105 --> 00:17:12.767
H-Her doll moved!

00:17:12.874 --> 00:17:15.775
Don't be stupid!
You're just a dumb old Mid-Boss!

00:17:15.977 --> 00:17:17.274
B-But it...

00:17:17.846 --> 00:17:18.972
Come on, let's go.

00:17:21.149 --> 00:17:23.083
See?! It just looked
at me!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.285
What a strange man.

00:17:29.824 --> 00:17:32.418
Oh, she isn't back yet?

00:17:33.728 --> 00:17:36.754
It sure is peaceful around here without
that little terror around, isn't it?

00:17:36.865 --> 00:17:39.834
Who knows, maybe she found herself
a new "big brother" somewhere!

00:17:44.005 --> 00:17:47.031
Come to think of it, Flonne
isn't around, either.

00:17:47.509 --> 00:17:51.070
Bad news, dood! Real bad!
It's a challenge letter!

00:17:51.179 --> 00:17:53.374
It's a challenge letter addressed
to you, Prince Laharl!

00:17:53.648 --> 00:17:55.047
Challenge letter?

00:17:57.452 --> 00:17:59.010
"Your sister is
in our custody."

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:02.487
"If you wish her returned to you,
come to the Netherworld Mines!"

00:18:02.624 --> 00:18:03.955
Signed, the
Netherworld Emperors.

00:18:04.092 --> 00:18:05.753
The Netherworld Emperors?!

00:18:05.894 --> 00:18:08.658
No way am I going to let that bunch
of bumpkin bikers interfere,

00:18:08.763 --> 00:18:12.164
not after I've played along
with her scheme for so long!

00:18:14.235 --> 00:18:17.170
Maharl! Where are you?

00:18:17.472 --> 00:18:21.340
Maharl, you said that you had something
that you wanted to ask me about!

00:18:21.443 --> 00:18:23.035
This is the right place,
isn't it?

00:18:25.814 --> 00:18:32.083
Aieee! It's the Netherworld Emperors!
Somebody help me!

00:18:32.287 --> 00:18:34.687
We're not bears, lady!

00:18:34.789 --> 00:18:37.349
Anyway, do you seriously think that
anyone will come to your rescue...

00:18:37.459 --> 00:18:39.450
...just because doing that old-school
"damsel in distress" screaming?

00:18:39.594 --> 00:18:41.061
Hold it right there!

00:18:41.162 --> 00:18:42.186
What the...?

00:18:43.565 --> 00:18:44.589
Beauty!

00:18:45.233 --> 00:18:47.895
The five of you assaulting one lonely
mademoiselle is hardly fair!

00:18:48.003 --> 00:18:49.834
How uncouth!

00:18:50.505 --> 00:18:52.302
There aren't five
of us!

00:18:53.975 --> 00:18:54.964
Maharl?

00:18:55.076 --> 00:18:59.137
I didn't expect to meet you
again in a place like this!

00:18:59.314 --> 00:19:02.044
I'll pretend I didn't see you!
Buh-bye!

00:19:02.617 --> 00:19:03.811
Good grief...

00:19:03.918 --> 00:19:06.478
He didn't come
to save me?

00:19:06.821 --> 00:19:12.555
You leave me no choice! I'll do whatever I can
to protect myself and Maharl from... Aieee!

00:19:13.228 --> 00:19:18.666
Look, that "damsel in distress" screaming isn't
going to make anybody come to your rescue!

00:19:18.767 --> 00:19:20.701
Hold it right there!

00:19:22.804 --> 00:19:26.831
Hand over my little sister!
We have unfinished business!

00:19:28.243 --> 00:19:30.438
You're not here
to save me?

00:19:30.879 --> 00:19:35.782
Now! As long as we have zis woman,
he can't lay a finger on us!

00:19:36.518 --> 00:19:39.817
What's with the accent?!
More to the point, what the heck is going on?!

00:19:40.188 --> 00:19:44.955
So, just when I thought you'd shown your true
colors, it turns out that you all were in cahoots!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:46.925
Highness, you had me convinced
that you had fallen for her trap!

00:19:47.395 --> 00:19:50.853
If you can't see through a ruse like zis,
you're not fit to be ze Overlord!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.199
Listen up, everyone!

00:19:53.301 --> 00:19:58.705
Put ze screws to Laharl and force him to
tell us ze location of ze Black Lizard's Tail!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:00.234
Right!

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:20.184
Big brother!

00:20:21.062 --> 00:20:25.192
Those bad people were threatening me,
and they forced me to trick you!

00:20:26.401 --> 00:20:30.269
I couldn't possibly be part
of their gang, right?

00:20:30.371 --> 00:20:32.430
You know that, don't
you, big brother?!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.337
Whoa, she's
selling 'em out!

00:20:34.442 --> 00:20:36.342
This is unforgivable.

00:20:36.444 --> 00:20:38.935
I had no idea that she was capable
of such treachery...

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.918
Big brother, help...

00:20:49.224 --> 00:20:51.158
Big brother, you big kidder...

00:20:51.259 --> 00:20:53.056
Well, this sucks.

00:20:53.194 --> 00:20:58.097
It's sad beyond words that we've been
led by someone like her for so long...

00:20:58.199 --> 00:20:59.496
Let's just get out
of here.

00:21:00.502 --> 00:21:03.232
What a terrible thing to do!
Frying your own little sister like this!

00:21:03.338 --> 00:21:05.465
This is too much,
even for you!

00:21:05.573 --> 00:21:08.542
Haven't you been listening to a single word
that's been said around here, lady?!

00:21:10.211 --> 00:21:12.406
I admire
your fiendishness,

00:21:12.514 --> 00:21:16.974
knowing so much about my father and
managing to fool me for so long.

00:21:17.719 --> 00:21:20.347
For that alone, I'll let you go
just this once.

00:21:21.189 --> 00:21:24.955
Now go! Run before I change
my mind! I don't care where!

00:21:25.193 --> 00:21:27.753
What's this, a heartwarming
scene of brotherly love?

00:21:27.862 --> 00:21:30.330
I think I'm gonna cry,
"big brother"!

00:21:33.234 --> 00:21:35.361
Look out!

00:21:39.974 --> 00:21:41.737
What's going on
around here?

00:21:41.843 --> 00:21:44.073
Your little sister
is a...

00:21:50.318 --> 00:21:51.785
Curses, I was
so close!

00:21:51.886 --> 00:21:55.083
Zis is all your fault,
you fool of a Mid-Boss!

00:21:55.423 --> 00:22:00.918
There are still many things in this world
that are best left unknown, Mademoiselle!

00:22:01.262 --> 00:22:03.958
Oh, thank goodness she
wasn't my love-child!

00:22:04.065 --> 00:22:07.466
Take me back!
Turn us around, Mid-Boss!

00:22:07.936 --> 00:22:09.301
You blithering fool!

00:22:09.404 --> 00:22:12.771
Pardon me for
being a fool!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:16.802
What is this, a
hidden camera show?

00:22:16.945 --> 00:22:19.914
Still, it sure knew a lot
about you, Laharl...

00:22:20.014 --> 00:22:22.574
Yeah, talk about strange...

00:22:42.303 --> 00:22:49.732
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:50.078 --> 00:22:57.814
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:58.119 --> 00:23:05.958
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:13.023
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:13.701 --> 00:23:21.472
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:21.576 --> 00:23:29.244
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:29.384 --> 00:23:36.688
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:37.392 --> 00:23:41.123
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:41.229 --> 00:23:45.222
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:46.134 --> 00:23:50.434
Chain react...

00:23:57.178 --> 00:24:01.672
Next time! 30 minutes OF the Prinnies,
BY the Prinnies, and FOR the Prinnies!

00:24:01.783 --> 00:24:04.911
In a word, it's "Pringer X"
next week, dood!

00:24:05.019 --> 00:24:09.456
Prinnies sing! Prinnies dance!
Prinnies twirl about!

00:24:09.791 --> 00:24:12.555
Get drunk off the melody of love
that the Prinnies will play!

00:24:13.161 --> 00:24:16.688
I'm so excited about this, dood!
We finally get to be the stars!

00:24:16.964 --> 00:24:19.262
Next time on Disgaea!

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:21.269
"The Prinnies'
Longest Day, Dood!"

00:24:21.269 --> 00:24:22.070
Next Time:
The Prinnies' Longest Day, Dood!
"The Prinnies'
Longest Day, Dood!"

00:24:22.070 --> 00:24:24.605
Next Time:
The Prinnies' Longest Day, Dood!
Don't miss it, all you Prinny
fanboys and girls out there!

00:24:24.605 --> 00:24:26.163
Next Time:
The Prinnies' Longest Day, Dood!
